# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# AUTHORING decks — these contain the speaker notes and the
# easter-egg answers. Students get docs/ instead, which build.py
# generates with the notes stripped out.
# NOTE: this means git is NOT backing these up. Keep a copy in
# Drive, or push them to a separate PRIVATE repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
